@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "前台" as A0
boundary "<u>:前台接口</u>" as B0
control "<u>:维护患者资料控</u>\n<u>制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:患者</u>" as Patient
participant "<u>:患者资料变更</u>" as IdentityChange
participant "<u>:代理关系</u>" as Proxy
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-08办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-08办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Patient : 核对身份候选(身份线索)
activate Patient
Patient --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Patient
K -> Patient : 确认资料维护(新值、原因、核实结论)
activate Patient
Patient -> IdentityChange : 保留修改依据(原值、新值、人员时间)
activate IdentityChange
IdentityChange --> Patient : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate IdentityChange
opt 需要登记或变更代理关系
Patient -> Proxy : 确认代理范围(关系、有效期及核实依据)
activate Proxy
Proxy --> Patient : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Proxy
end
Patient --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Patient
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
note over K,Proxy
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
